# PrintMomentum FE

- Vite + React 19 SPA. Not Next.js. No App Router, no server actions.
- API base is `/api` (dev proxy to Spring Boot `:8080`).
- Ranked **printable** tees by climb speed. Do not show non-print apparel.
- Read `.cursor/skills/` instead of browsing React/Etsy docs.
- One branch per `docs/TASKS.csv` row.
- `npm test` and `npm run build` must pass.
